content.text:
The root cause is a single pod failure in **ts-station-service**. Its first pod stopped at 09:38:38 and was replaced by a new pod at 09:39:36. During that gap, ts-basic-service got "Connection refused" errors and passed them up through travel, travel2, route-plan and travel-plan to the UI.

